      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The theme area turns the workspace's style settings into the one resolved style every renderer reads, and into the paint each color pick takes under it. The theme model is owned by design. This area records where theme code lives, how it splits, and what may import it."
        }
